## A) SIN x-payment-chain  (el comportamiento de HEAD, el defecto)

$ curl -s -X POST .../compose -H 'content-type: application/json' -d "$BODY"
HTTP 402
{"error":"payment-signature header is required","accepts":[{"scheme":"exact",
 "network":"eip155:2368",
 "maxAmountRequired":"30300000000000000",
 "payTo":"0xf432baf1315ccDB23E683B95b03fD54Dd3e447Ba","maxTimeoutSeconds":300,
 "asset":"0x8E04D099b1a8Dd20E6caD4b2Ab2B405B98242ec9",
 "extra":null,"merchantName":"WasiAI"}],"x402Version":2}

  network eip155:2368  = kite-ozone-testnet
  asset   0x8E04...2ec9 = PYUSD, 18 decimales
  30300000000000000 / 1e18 = 0,0303  ->  **0,0303 PYUSD**

